<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for reaching out to the Qantas Customer Care team requesting a letter for your insurance company.</p>

<p><strong>Contact the operating airline directly</strong><br />
<br />
Qantas is only able to provide a letter confirming delays to the services we operate.<br />
<br />
When your flight is operated by another carrier, including Jetstar or any of our codeshare partners, any confirmation of delays or cancellations will need to be provided by the airline operating that service.<br />
<br />
This means that you'll need to contact <strong>&lt;airline&gt; </strong>on<strong> &lt;number&gt;</strong> directly to obtain a letter for your insurance claim.</p>
</body>
